{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-1","title":{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]的遭遇","en":"Encounter in [This.System.GetName]"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/9b297bcf4290925d7401.webp","start":"first_contact.1","chapters":5,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们已成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的神秘外星人建立第一次接触。从今开始至知悉更详细的信息为止，我们将其代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。如果他们具有语言，我们必须进行破译才能建立交流。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. For now, we have code-named them [This.ContactCountry.GetName], until we can find out more about them. If they possess a language, we must decipher it in order to establish "},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1","n2","n3","n4","n5"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.1","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact.2000","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]},"n3":{"doc":"first_contact.3000","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]},"n4":{"doc":"first_contact.4000","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]},"n5":{"doc":"grand_archive.2800","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.1","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]的遭遇","en":"Encounter in [This.System.GetName]"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们已成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的神秘外星人建立第一次接触。从今开始至知悉更详细的信息为止，我们将其代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。如果他们具有语言，我们必须进行破译才能建立交流。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. For now, we have code-named them [This.ContactCountry.GetName], until we can find out more about them. If they possess a language, we must decipher it in order to establish communications."},{"zh":"我们已成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的神秘外星人建立第一次接触。从今开始至知悉更详细的信息为止，我们将其代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。如果他们具有语言，我们必须进行破译才能评估他们的威胁程度。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. For now, we have code-named them [This.ContactCountry.GetName], until we can find out more about them. If they possess a language, we should decipher it so that we can assess how much of a threat they pose."},{"zh":"我们已经成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的未知外星人建立第一次接触。我们必须尽快衡量他们是否为有机体，以方便我们将它们的灭绝程序尽早提上日程。从现在起，我们代称他们为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。","en":"We have made first contact with unknown aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. We must determine whether they are organic with all haste so that their termination can be scheduled, should it prove necessary. For now, they have been given the designation [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."},{"zh":"我们已经成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的神秘外星人建立第一次接触。我们应当获取更多关于他们的信息以便确定他们是否是子个体的优质营养来源。从现在起，他们被代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. We should find out more about them so that we may decide whether they would be suitable nutrition for our drones. For now, they have been given the designation [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."},{"zh":"我们已经成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的神秘外星人建立第一次接触。我们应当获取更多关于他们的信息以便确定他们是否是我们的下一个净化目标。从现在起，他们被代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. We should find out more about them so we can assess whether they should be our next targets for extermination. For now, they have been given the designation [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."},{"zh":"我们已经成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的神秘外星人建立第一次接触。我们应当探明他们是否可以和我们进行沟通，如果是的话，是否应当投入我们自身的一部分来翻译他们的语言。从现在起，他们被代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. We should find out whether they are capable of communicating with us, and dedicate a portion of ourselves to translating their language if this proves to be the case. For now, they have been given the designation [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."},{"zh":"我们已经成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的新生命形式建立第一次接触。我们应当探明他们是否可以和我们进行沟通。如果可以，我们也许该以自我的一种更小的部分出现——例如一个化身之类的。\n\n在对其有更深入了解之前，他们被代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious new lifeforms in the [This.System.GetName] system. We do not yet know if they are capable of communicating with us. If they cannot do so, we may be compelled to present a smaller portion of ourselves - an avatar, of sorts.\n\nUntil we can learn more about these aliens, we have named them the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."},{"zh":"我们已经成功与[This.System.GetName]星系的神秘外星人建立第一次接触。我们应当探明他们是否可以和我们进行沟通，如果是的话，是否应当投入我们的翻译算法来破解他们的语言。从现在起，他们被代称为[This.ContactCountry.GetName]。","en":"We have made first contact with mysterious aliens in the [This.System.GetName] system. We should find out whether they possess a method of communication we can parse, and dedicate our translation algorithms to decoding it if this proves to be the case. For now, they have been given the designation [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/9b297bcf4290925d7401.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"INTERESTING","label":{"zh":"真是有趣。","en":"Interesting."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"leviathans.98","kind":"condition","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"condition","group":"c11649","delay":[{"days":"720","random":"360"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_origin","arg":"origin_slavers","scope":"contact_country","value":false,"label":{"zh":"通天之梯","en":"Your Ladder To The Sky"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_slave_origin","arg":"yes","scope":"root.owner","value":false},