:"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":false,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":false,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":2}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":true,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":3}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":4}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":true,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":5}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}},{"type":"identity","key":"is_wilderness_empire","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":6}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"is_wilderness_empire","value":true}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":7}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}]]}],"names":{"This.System.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"},"This.ContactCountry.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"}}},{"id":"first_contact.2000","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"龙的通信","en":"Draconic Communications"},"texts":[{"zh":"基于我们与许多外星物种构建通讯的成功经历，我们的一位[This.Owner.GetLinguists]提出了一项激进的举措。虽然过去所有与天龙沟通的努力均不幸失败，[needed_name.GetSheHe]坚称[needed_name.GetSXX]现在是进一步尝试的好机会。\n\n根据我们最古老的历史，[This.Owner.Species.GetName]曾一度与龙建立了传说中的契约，正是由它结束的正面冲突。据此，某种程度的互相理解应该是可以达成的。[needed_name.GetSheHe]指出[needed_name.GetSXX]我们过去与外星生命体之间通讯的成功让我们比起过去任何时候都更有能力理解这条巨龙。","en":"Following our successes in establishing communications with a number of alien species, one of our leading [This.Owner.GetLinguists] has brought forth a radical proposal. Though past efforts to communicate with the Sky Dragon have failed miserably, [needed_name.GetSheHe] argue[needed_name.GetSXX] that now is the time to make another attempt.\n\nAccording to our earliest histories, there was a fabled Accord between [This.Owner.Species.GetName] and Dragon, after which direct conflict ceased. Citing this as proof that understanding on some level is possible, [needed_name.GetSheHe] note[needed_name.GetSXX] that our recent experiences with utterly alien lifeforms make us better equipped than ever before to understand the drake."},{"zh":"在成功与数个外星物种成功建立通讯之后，我们的语言思维处理体得出结论，现在正是我们再次同天龙建立对话的时候。尽管最近的努力均不幸失败，我们依旧模糊地回忆起了过去的片段，彼时我们在古老的冲突之后，同这条龙缔结了和平。\n\n现在我们在同形体完全不同的外星生命体打交道上有了更加丰富的经验，我们相较于过去任何时候，都在理解龙这一方面准备的更加充分。","en":"Having established communications with a number of alien species, our linguistic thought processes have concluded that it is time for us to again attempt to converse with the Sky Dragon. Though recent efforts have failed miserably, we dimly recall a past understanding when we made peace with the dragon, following our ancient struggle.\n\nNow that we have more experience in dealing with utterly alien lifeforms, we are better equipped than ever before to understand the drake."},{"zh":"在成功与数个外星物种成功建立通讯之后，我们的语言子例程得出了一个全新的共识：现在正是我们再次同天龙建立对话的时候。尽管最近所有有意义的尝试手段均以失败告终，我们的造物主留下的记录显示，达成某种程度的理解是可能的。毕竟，彼时他们应该发生了战斗，然后同龙缔结了和平，尽管是什么愿意我们不得而知。\n\n现在我们在同形体完全不同的外星生命体打交道上有了更加丰富的经验，我们相较于过去任何时候，都在理解龙这一方面准备的更加充分。","en":"Having established communications with a number of alien species, our linguistic subroutines have reached a new consensus: it is again time to attempt to converse with the Sky Dragon. Though past efforts have failed by all meaningful criteria, the records of our creators suggest that understanding on some level is possible. After all, they supposedly fought and then made peace with the dragon, for hitherto unknown reasons.\n\nEquipped with experience in dealing with utterly alien lifeforms, we are now better prepared than ever before to seek to understand the drake."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/9b297bcf4290925d7401.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"INTERESTING","label":{"zh":"真是有趣。","en":"Interesting."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"leviathans.98","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13638","delay":[{"days":"720","random":"360"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_origin","arg":"origin_slavers","scope":"contact_country","value":false,"label":{"zh":"通天之梯","en":"Your Ladder To The Sky"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_slave_origin","arg":"yes","scope":"root.owner","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}]]],"through":["leviathans.97"],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:63","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"event-leviathans-98"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13638","delay":[{"days":"720","random":"360"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_origin","arg":"origin_slavers","scope":"contact_country","value":false,"label":{"zh":"通天之梯","en":"Your Ladder To The Sky"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default