"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}]]}]},{"key":"first_contact.3000.b.execution","label":{"zh":"净化这个入侵我们首都的东西！","en":"Purge this invader from our capital!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"净化这个入侵我们首都的东西！","en":"Purge this invader from our capital!"},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":true,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":true,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"牺牲。","en":"A sacrifice."},"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_death_cult_empire","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]}]},{"key":"first_contact.3000.c.hive","label":{"zh":"天降外卖！","en":"A snack from the sky!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_necrophage","value":true,"label":{"zh":"食尸文化","en":"Necrophage"}}]]},{"key":"first_contact.3000.d.assimilator","label":{"zh":"自己人。自己人。","en":"One of us. One of us."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"万爪之母作为一名领袖加入了我们。","en":"The The Many-Tentacled One joins our ranks as a leader."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_assimilator","value":true,"label":{"zh":"同化斗士","en":"Driven Assimilator"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_events.txt","line":11261},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":true,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":false,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}}]]}],"names":{"This.Owner.Capital.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"first_contact.4000","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"同MSI接触","en":"Contact With MSI"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们已与[MSI_country.GetName]取得联系。当务之急的事情是，我们必须要小心翼翼地驾驭不断变化的局势。我们应该派遣一名特使来代表我们的利益。无论与我们以前的主人进行任何互动，这肯定会对我们的人民产生深远的心理影响。","en":"Contact has been made with [MSI_country.GetName]. It's imperative that we navigate the evolving situation carefully. An envoy should be be dispatched to represent our interests. Any interaction with our former masters is sure to have a profound psychological effect on our people."},{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]遭遇的外星飞船上得到的数据让我们不寒而栗。它的外观我们再熟悉不过了，上面的徽章宛如我们恐惧的象征：弥那玛特种实业集团的带翼图章。\n\n我们找到了曾经的侵略者。他们发现我们这些舰船的身份只是时间的问题，因为使用的完全都是他们的科技。新的接触不可避免，但我们绝不会重复过去的错误。","en":"Data on the alien vessels we encountered in the [This.System.GetName] was met with a shudder of recognition. Familiar ship designs, marked by an emblem we learned to fear: the winged logo of the Minamar Specialized Industries.\n\nOur former invaders have been found. It's only a matter of time until they realize the ships they sighted are ours, fueled by their own technology. A new contact may be unavoidable, but we can avoid repeating past errors."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/49238b3a2ea53b060771.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.4000.a.bs","label":{"zh":"令人恼火。","en":"Infuriating."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"leviathans.98","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13648","delay":[{"days":"720","random":"360"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_origin","arg":"origin_slavers","scope":"contact_country","value":false,"label":{"zh":"通天之梯","en":"Your Ladder To The Sky"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_slave_origin","arg":"yes","scope":"root.owner","value":false},{"type":"other","